sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orch as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server<br/>(indirect)
    participant Det as Guardrails Detectors<br/>(indirect)

    Note over Client,Det: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>GW: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer token<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>{"messages": [...], "stream": false}
    activate GW

    Note over GW: Route matched → inject detectors<br/>from route config into payload<br/>(detectors.input + detectors.output)

    GW->>GW: Forward Authorization +<br/>X-Forwarded-* headers

    GW->>Orch: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP or HTTPS (optional mTLS)<br/>{"messages": [...], "detectors": {...}}
    activate Orch

    Orch->>vLLM: Forward inference request
    vLLM-->>Orch: LLM response

    Orch->>Det: Run configured detectors<br/>on input/output content
    Det-->>Orch: Detection results

    Orch-->>GW: JSON response with<br/>choices + detections array
    deactivate Orch

    alt Detections found AND route has fallback_message
        Note over GW: Replace choices content<br/>with fallback_message
        GW-->>Client: {"choices": [{"message": {"content": "fallback_message"}}]}
    else No detections OR no fallback configured
        GW-->>Client: {"choices": [{"message": {"content": "LLM response"}}]}
    end
    deactivate GW

    Note over Client,Det: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion with Detection (SSE)

    Client->>GW: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer token<br/>{"messages": [...], "stream": true}
    activate GW

    Note over GW: Route matched → inject detectors<br/>+ set stream=true

    GW->>Orch: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP or HTTPS (optional mTLS)<br/>{"messages": [...], "detectors": {...}, "stream": true}
    activate Orch

    Orch->>vLLM: Forward streaming request
    Orch->>Det: Run detectors per chunk

    loop SSE chunks from orchestrator
        Orch-->>GW: data: {"choices": [{"delta": {"content": "..."}}]}
        Note over GW: Parse each SSE data: line<br/>Check for detections in chunk

        alt Detection found in chunk
            GW-->>Client: data: {"choices": [{"delta": {"content": "fallback_msg"}, "finish_reason": "stop"}]}
            Note over GW: Stream terminated<br/>with fallback message
        else No detection
            GW-->>Client: data: {"choices": [{"delta": {"content": "token"}}]}
        end
    end

    Orch-->>GW: data: [DONE]
    deactivate Orch
    GW-->>Client: data: [DONE]
    deactivate GW
